Z||000003||DecadenceR||06-06-2001||02:34 PM||||Don't feel bad man.<BR>All of my friends tell me to "Just give up and go buy a new car..."<BR>I bought this 84SE in Feb for $325. Since then i have replaced the head gasket, lifters, pushrods, rocker arms, springs, valve seals, top end gaskets and bolts, front shocks, all but 1 motor mount (that one's on back order), washer fluid pump, 2 tires, plus things like the filters and plugs and such.<BR>Now with all the money I put into this so far (not to mention the blood I lost...) I could have afforded a down payment on something new.<BR>but when it's new, its not yours.<BR>Granted, i have a long way to go before I'm done with my car.<BR>But when I get there, it'll be that much more of ME in that car. I'll be one with it.<BR>So I tell all my friends to go to hell.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
