Z||000018||Fierokid87||06-07-2001||12:06 AM||||You all are depressing me.  My fiero is up on jacks with no engine.  The last time I drive it was like a 10 min drive with Craig (Fieromaster) to move it to it final resting place (atleast for now).  But anyway.  I wish girls would look at my Fiero the way everyone is saying.  And you people are right this one guy I know in PA when he rides in my Fiero he says this car handles awesome.  then he gets out says that Fiero handles like #$$^& when he is around his friends.  You know what I do?  I take his freinds out after he tells them.  and they come back and ask him if he was in the right car!  LOL.  Anyway.  no engine (4cyld) can only mean one thing......V-6 conversion!<P>Scott<P>AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid<P>web site: <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero/</A> ||||reg||9
